# Normalize all text files to LF in the index AND in the working tree.
# `text=auto` alone only guarantees LF in the index; working-tree line endings
# would still follow core.autocrlf / core.eol (CRLF on Windows). The explicit
# `eol=lf` pins the working tree to LF too, killing phantom CRLF-only diffs.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets — never subject to EOL conversion or diff.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.zip binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
